| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Viability Floor** | Minimum coupling for oscillation | [geometric:precedes](#fold-point) |
| **Chaos Ceiling** | Maximum coupling for stability | [symmetric:constrains](#delay) |
| **Parametric Wall** | Limit on landscape reshaping | [dynamical:interacts_with](#resonance) |
